title: LinOTP Storage Encryption
agents: linotp_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Reports whether LinOTP's storage encryption (protection of token secrets
 and sensitive config values, via /monitoring/storageEncryption) is
 active.

 Goes CRIT when encryption is reported inactive or the endpoint could not
 be queried, otherwise OK with the configured crypto module name/type.

item:
 None. One "LinOTP Storage Encryption" service is created per configured
 host.

discovery:
 One "LinOTP Storage Encryption" service is discovered on the host
 running the special agent.
